{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Latch manager termination before completing the handler body.** The manager completes operation futures before its execution-failure future, so a waiter can wake, throw from a handler `finally`, and complete `body` first. This turns an already-triggered `PENDING`/`RETRYING` outcome into terminal `FAILED`. Publish a tagged manager outcome before waking operation waiters, and add a natural step/wait suspension test whose `finally` throws immediately.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77prNd","finding_digest":"3c492213fc3c17d100b45559eeb019afbc7cf6f1cb8d2177039144ea9acf2714","finding_id":"arf_v1_hresee74hql5cafukvm65mazv6","finding_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::invocation-execute::selected-outcome-race","identity_key":"sdk/durableexecutor::invocation-execute::selected-outcome-race","line":124,"observation_digest":"336b2283cbdf9cccbe569f82de7af0136ae2a278de07f6fd32de0c4abccc3aae","observation_id":"aro_v1_gnvsfa6l36omzpswt6bn46xqcn","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_hresee74hql5cafukvm65mazv6","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:14:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_grkwaczu4aivmar2k54gjgmfva","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"478c183131454e220afd5752f5ff5c133a37202f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":124,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_vcftnguq7ksofjuylkx2pq4ai3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:14:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
